      en: ["First utility-scale solar park in East Africa (2014).", "Capacity of 8.5 megawatts.", "Increased Rwanda's electricity generation capacity by 6%.", "Located on the grounds of the Agahozo-Shalom Youth Village.", "Reduces CO2 emissions by thousands of tons annually.", "Developed through a public-private partnership.", "Major step in diversifying Rwanda's energy mix."],
