      en: ["One of the leading tea estates in Rwanda.", "Produces award-winning orthodox black tea.", "Located in a region with ideal growing conditions.", "Works with thousands of smallholder farmers in cooperatives.", "Major employer and driver of the local economy.", "Invests in social projects for the community.", "Contributes to the excellent reputation of Rwandan tea."],
